126		 * would have addressed did not exist and a header pointing at a {@code 404} is worse than
127		 * its absence. Ticket 15 builds that resource, so the header arrives with it — the order
128		 * {@code docs/deferred.md} names for the Account's missing endpoint, applied here.
129		 *
