169		/**
170		 * A Transfer across two Currencies, end to end over the wire: the destination is credited
171		 * in its own Currency and the rate that got it there is reported with the moment it was
172		 * quoted, so a settled conversion can be checked rather than taken on trust.
173		 *
174		 * <p>HUF on the credited side because its Minor Units are not hundredths, so a figure
175		 * that had picked up or lost a division by a hundred would still read plausibly in EUR
